@Pinta.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5084
@token = reemplazar-por-un-token-jwt

### Solicitud de ejemplo original
GET {{Pinta.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Crear un post
POST {{Pinta.API_HostAddress}}/api/post
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Mi primer post",
  "body": "Contenido del post"
}

###
